  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 4.259,
   "text": "Small popcorn, five dollars. Large, nine. Most people pick the small."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 4.509,
   "end": 6.877,
   "text": "Then the theater adds a medium, for eight dollars."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 7.377,
   "end": 10.683,
   "text": "Suddenly the large looks like a steal. Only one dollar more!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.933,
   "end": 13.707,
   "text": "That medium isn't really there to be bought. It's a decoy."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 14.207,
   "end": 19.753,
   "text": "In a famous classroom test, students picked a magazine deal: web only, or print plus web for more."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 20.003,
   "end": 23.737,
   "text": "Web only: about sixty dollars. Print plus web: one twenty-five."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 23.987,
   "end": 25.459,
   "text": "Most picked the cheaper web deal."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 25.709,
   "end": 30.189,
   "text": "Then a silly print-only option was added, at the same price as print plus web."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 30.439,
   "end": 33.681,
   "text": "Nobody chose it. But now most students picked print plus web."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 34.181,
   "end": 38.512,
   "text": "It was a small classroom test, and later studies found decoys don't always work."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 38.762,
   "end": 41.151,
   "text": "These popcorn prices are just an example."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 41.651,
   "end": 46.259,
   "text": "So Tony added a medium soda. Small, two. Medium, three fifty. Large, four."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 46.509,
   "end": 48.088,
   "text": "Guess which one everybody ordered?"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 48.588,
   "end": 52.129,
   "text": "That's the end of part five. Follow for more sneaky business tricks."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 52.379,
   "end": 56.326,
   "text": "And next time you see three sizes, ask: which one do they want me to buy?"
  }
 ]
